      "title": "Image: text to image with FLUX.2 Klein 4B",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Image: text to image with FLUX.2 Klein 4B\n\nMakes up to 4 images from a prompt with FLUX.2 Klein 4B in 4 steps. Built from Comfy's template image_flux2_klein_text_to_image.\n\n## Models\n\n- [flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors): FLUX.2 Klein 4B, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B).\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors): Qwen3 4B text encoder, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B).\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors): FLUX.2 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
